      "start_seconds": 311.0,
      "end_seconds": 333.04,
      "duration_seconds": 22.04,
      "text": "I think an ultrasound of the tummy makes sense here, for right upper quadrant pain keep meals small and low in fat until we have the scan i'm going to send a referral to the surgeons book a review after the ultrasound can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
